<3 Problem 1: Hello Pi - Emoji version

<3 Define PI constant
PI :=) 3.141592653589793

<3 Read radius as a double (simplified - no string conversion needed)
r :=) -0-0-

<3 Calculate circumference = 2.0 * PI * r
temp1 :=) 2.0 :*) PI
circumference :=) temp1 :*) r

<3 Calculate area = PI * r * r
temp2 :=) r :*) r
area :=) PI :*) temp2

<3 Print results
:P("Hello, User")
:P("circumference =", circumference)
:P("area =", area)